{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":18,"count":41,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-14\",\"再見\",\"再見\",\"再见\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"再(again) + 見(see) = see you again, which is what 再見 means: good-bye."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-09\",\"飛機\",\"飛機\",\"飞机\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"飛(fly) + 機(machine) → a flying machine, an airplane."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-03\",\"父親\",\"父親\",\"父亲\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我父親文章寫得很好，而且他的字也很漂亮。","pinyin":"Wǒ fùqīn wénzhāng xiě de hěn hǎo, érqiě tā de zì yě hěn piàoliang.","english":"My father writes articles very well, and moreover his handwriting is also very beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-03","sourceFront":"父親","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你打算用什麼方式慶祝父親六十歲的生日？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-19","sourceFront":"方式","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父親的職業是大學教授，母親在郵局上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-02","sourceFront":"職業","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父親是保險公司的經理，要管理很多員工。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-25","sourceFront":"員工","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小陳很孝順，每個週末都去安養院陪父親聊天、散步，一點兒都不覺得辛苦","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-23","sourceFront":"孝順","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張不想增加父親的負擔，為了負擔自己的學費，一下課就去打工。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-24","sourceFront":"負擔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"章先生念國小時，父親帶著他上山下海、到處旅遊，那是屬於他們的美好記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-13","sourceFront":"記憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父親是個警察，只要他負責的小組有重要任務時，就得出差一兩個星期。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-22","sourceFront":"任務","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照中國的傳統觀念，女人未嫁時得聽父親的話，嫁了人之後就得聽丈夫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-43","sourceFront":"丈夫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"父(father) + 親(relatives) → your father is a close relative."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-17\",\"約會\",\"約會\",\"约会\",\"Vi/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王小姐跟男朋友約會的時候，都穿著很漂亮的衣服。今天晚上哥哥跟女朋友有個約會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-17","sourceFront":"約會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"第一次約會的時候，林先生感覺(到)自己很緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林小姐弄錯了約會的時間，所以遲到了半個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-19","sourceFront":"弄錯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我姐姐最近戀愛了，每個週末都跟男朋友約會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-25","sourceFront":"戀愛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小章已經結婚了，還常常跟其他女生約會，真是太花心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-26","sourceFront":"花心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:要是你發現男朋友對你越來越冷淡，還常跟女網友約會， 你會原諒他嗎？ B:這麼花心的男人，絕對不值得原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-23","sourceFront":"原諒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"淡水的夕陽很美，如此的美麗風景，是約會的極佳地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:喲，你今天怎麼穿得這麼帥？ B:下午要參加公司茶會，得穿得正式一些？ A:那下次跟我約會時，也要這麼穿呦！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-03","sourceFront":"喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-03\",\"房東\",\"房東\",\"房东\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"房東給了我鑰匙，明天就可以搬進去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-47","sourceFront":"搬","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我下禮拜要跟房東簽約，你可以陪我去嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-42","sourceFront":"簽約","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我的房東都是每個月五號來收房租的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-15","sourceFront":"收","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我很喜歡那個房子，看房子當天就跟房東簽約了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-15","sourceFront":"當天","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的房東只提供家具、電視和冰箱，以外的東西他不管。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-19","sourceFront":"以外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-09\",\"臥室\",\"臥室/臥房\",\"卧室/卧房\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你的臥室看起來真漂亮！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-19","sourceFront":"起來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"陳小姐從小就愛史努比，所以臥房裡到處都是史努比的娃娃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-08","sourceFront":"從小","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣一般舊公寓的房子大約三十多坪，有客廳、廚房、一間浴室和三間臥房。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-19","sourceFront":"坪","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-2-14\",\"保养\",\"保養\",\"保养\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的汽車每半年就需要保養一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-14","sourceFront":"保養","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"冬天一到，我的皮膚就變得很乾，所以得注意保養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-26","sourceFront":"皮膚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我媽媽很會保養，看起來又年輕又漂亮，很多人都以為我們是姊妹。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-32","sourceFront":"姊妹","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顏太太很會保養，母子兩人站在一起時，看起來就像一對姊弟。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-18","sourceFront":"母子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個保養品很適合皮膚乾的人，所以秋冬兩個季節銷售得非常好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-12","sourceFront":"銷售","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"廚師們都會好好保養他們的用具，以免影響做菜的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-17","sourceFront":"用具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"銀做的東西雖然漂亮，不過不好保養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-18","sourceFront":"銀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"潮溼的居住環境不僅使家具不容易保養，並且更可能傷害人體健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-19","sourceFront":"潮溼","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-27\",\"翻\",\"翻\",\"翻\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的英文、日文都很好，畢業以後想當翻譯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-27","sourceFront":"翻","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這篇文章的中文翻譯翻得很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-26","sourceFront":"翻譯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"現在開始上課，請大家把書翻到第九課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-03","sourceFront":"翻","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我每次翻譯日文小說的時候，都要查字典。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-25","sourceFront":"字典","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"王教授推薦我去念那個研究所的翻譯課程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-05","sourceFront":"課程","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sour