ourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-20\",\"前進\",\"前進\",\"前进\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"爬山時如果碰到大雨就應避免繼續前進，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前進","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我新學的舞蹈很複雜，常忘了什麼時候前進或後退。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-13","sourceFront":"複雜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著科技進步，醫學也不斷前進，當醫師的人得多充實自己。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-41","sourceFront":"醫學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-33\",\"乡村\",\"鄉村\",\"乡村\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"鄉村生活雖然不如都市那樣方便，但風景美多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-33","sourceFront":"鄉村","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"鵝一看到陌生人就會大叫，所以鄉村裡有人把鵝當成狗來看家(kānjiā， to guard the house)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-50","sourceFront":"鵝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"春假時我打算到泰國小島上的鄉村去度個假。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-19","sourceFront":"度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-41\",\"夢想\",\"夢想\",\"梦想\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我夢想有一天可以到世界各地旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-41","sourceFront":"夢想","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每天光說夢想，一點兒用都沒有，還是努力實現比較實在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-42","sourceFront":"實現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他的夢想是利用水來當作交通工具的燃料，可是很多人認為不可能。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-53","sourceFront":"燃料","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我心中有兩個夢想，一是當歌星，另一個是去各國旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-05","sourceFront":"另","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小年的夢想就是蓋一棟土地面積六十坪、三層樓高的房子，讓全家人都住在一起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-08","sourceFront":"面積","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"易先生對戲劇有很大的興趣，小時候的夢想就是當一名成功的演員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-16","sourceFront":"戲劇","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"林小姐從小就希望有一家屬於自己的麵包店，今年終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-16","sourceFront":"屬於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小在追求夢想的路上，別太在意別人說什麼，只要不斷地努力，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-31","sourceFront":"在意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"不管追求夢想的路上有多辛苦，都是我們一輩子珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-13","sourceFront":"回憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我一直想到歐洲去旅行，只是現在忙得沒時間去，希望明年能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-33","sourceFront":"只是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"章先生一直想當律師，經過多年的努力，終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-23","sourceFront":"終於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小韓早晚都打工，是因為想多存一些錢，早一點完成出國念書的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-09","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:我希望將來能當一名很棒的導演。 B:我相信只要你不斷地努力，就能夢想成真的！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-22","sourceFront":"夢想成真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在追求夢想的路上，會遇到很困難的事情，只有不斷努力，才能完成夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-01","sourceFront":"追求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有人說，有夢最美。應該趁著年輕勇敢地做夢，更要努力讓夢想變成真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-18","sourceFront":"做夢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"美美最大的夢想是，將來能有一棟又漂亮又舒服的大房子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-01","sourceFront":"夢想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:你說自己沒有想做的事，難道你沒有夢想嗎？ B:我只想簡單過生活，再說，沒有夢想難道不行嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-48","sourceFront":"難道","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"擁有一架小飛機並親自在天空上駕駛，一直是孫小姐的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-15","sourceFront":"駕駛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然受到了重大的挫折，可是他並沒有放棄自己的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-23","sourceFront":"並","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 夢(dream) and 想(think): 夢想 means dream job, career, goal."},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-02\",\"辞职\",\"辭職\",\"辞职\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的計畫使公司賠了一大筆錢，因此他以辭職表示負責。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-02","sourceFront":"辭職","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"公司的待遇不公平，於是他決定辭職。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-24","sourceFront":"公平","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-12\",\"劳工\",\"勞工\",\"劳工\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了保住勞工的福利，她到處去演講。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-12","sourceFront":"勞工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"一般來說\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Taking 一(one) general 般(sort) of observation to 來(arrive) and 說(speak): 一般來說 means generally speaking."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"台灣高鐵\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"台灣(Taiwan) + 高(high) + 鐵(rail) → Taiwan's high-speed rail."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"放\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 方(direction) arrow takes a 攵(rap) launch → ready to 放(put) it down."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"款\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"An earnest 士(scholar) kneels before a sacred 示(altar) praying for relief when they 欠(lack) 款(funds)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"眾\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 罒(net) over 乑(stand side by side) catches a crowd; that crowd is 眾(multitude)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"社\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Gathering around a sacred 礻(spirit) shrine rooted firmly in the ancestral 土(soil) unites the entire 社(group)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"絕大部分\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 絕(cut) high 大(big) proportion of the whole 部(department) in this 分(divide): 絕大部分 means the majority of."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"績\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"She knots 糹(silk) around her 責(duty) and earns 績(achievements)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"脾\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"An essential organ of internal ⺼(meat) quietly performing 卑(humble) filtration work inside the body is the 脾(spleen)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"親人\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Devoted family members bound to your 親(relatives) as kin 人(person): 親人 means kinsfolk."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"這下子\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Given 這(this) situation right 下(below) now with suffix 子(son): 這下子 means now, thus."}]}
